# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/

# Worker-writable runtime state. Never committed: claim files, the merge-slot
# lease, telemetry, and a markdown tracker's live records. `.harness/stacks/`
# and `.harness/frameworks/` are project config and ARE tracked, which is why
# this ignores the run/task directories rather than the whole tree.
**/.harness/run/
**/.harness/tasks/
**/.harness/cache/

# Agent worktrees. Without this, `git add -A` commits them as embedded repos.
**/.claude/worktrees/

# Per-worker scratch, written at a worktree's root by the worker bootstrap. Ignored so a
# worktree never reads as dirty for it and the sweep can reclaim it.
**/.swarm*

.DS_Store
